      "created_at": "2025-09-30T13:05:22.106Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is <code>prompt=login</code> as query param to Authorization endpoint. Try that.</p>\n<p>Set that in <code>Auth URL Data</code></p>\n<p>e.g</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"json\"><code class=\"lang-json\">{\"scope\":\"openid email roles profile\",\"response_type\":\"code\",\"prompt\":\"login\"}\n</code></pre>",
